Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:48:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: navigation, full CRUD, validation, RTL UI and PWA

- tab navigation (dashboard / models / payments)
- add/edit/delete for models and payments with confirm dialog
- form validation with inline errors
- mobile-first Arabic RTL styling
- PWA manifest, service worker, icons
- API: writes via POST (text/plain), token support
- apps-script/Code.gs backend with doPost + id-based update/delete
- add .env.example
